{"title":"2026 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/c/42c06de735d79f0b28c30bcbbcf96e67bb1ca42c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b, c, d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> are four consecutive positive integers with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/a/79aaead4a185db1b2c9c7ccf238bd329165edfc4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a &lt; b &lt; c &lt; d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"109\" height=\"15\" />. The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/2/4927b32689fdf8608dd353ffa09ce48e970a0bf5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a + d) - (b + c)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"132\" height=\"20\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/6/f96a8fd9d20ac08532ce555300d3b22c7bfb244c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ -1 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 0 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 1 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 2 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"410\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the numbers are consecutive, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/9/129ab77611be6439b9a2b759bc0684d19cc7df01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d = a + 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/b/9abdac83cf561235f391e98904ad1b0cdde47d97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = a + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/d/5ed6b1998a765c224e1ed4ebd2da3806f5f4ccc1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = a + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" />. We then have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/2/97287e499f0c772e02a0c4403b4e44cb1ef33002.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a + d) - (b + c) = (a + a + 3) - (a + 2 + a + 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"383\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/b/80bb094086240737d3422a83e2dfda65b4a20102.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=(2a + 3) - (2a + 3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"172\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/d/c0dfc02eaa1ad6a3ffd93702edece82e83c54eca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } 0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"76\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Fermat\" title=\"2026 CEMC Fermat\">2026 CEMC Fermat</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Fermat_Problems\" title=\"2026 CEMC Fermat Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Fermat_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC Fermat Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php